## OptionalDeps: LibDataBroker-1.1, LibDBIcon-1.0

# --- Libraries ---
#
# Only what the minimap button needs. LibDBIcon hard-errors without
# LibDataBroker, which needs CallbackHandler, which needs LibStub - four
# folders for one button, and the reason it is worth it is in
# MinimapButton.lua's header.
Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\CallbackHandler-1.0\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
Libs\LibDataBroker-1.1\LibDataBroker-1.1.lua
Libs\LibDBIcon-1.0\LibDBIcon-1.0.lua

# --- Main ---
# Load order is a dependency chain: WallhackUiKit needs nothing, the core
# exports to TagTeamView, and SlashCommands reads ns.ToggleView from it.
#
# WallhackUiKit.lua is shared verbatim with WhoDoesWhat - see its header before editing.
TagTeam.lua
WallhackUiKit.lua
TagTeamView.lua
MinimapButton.lua
SlashCommands.lua
